<title>UK: Direct Marketing Assn names Rawlinson PR manager.</title>
<headline>Direct Marketing Assn names Rawlinson PR manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Direct Marketing Association on Thursday said it named Jenny Rawlinson as public relations manager.</p>
<p>Rawlinson, who was previously communications director at Railtrack South West, replaces Gabrielle Wilson.</p>
<p>-- London Advertising Newsdesk +44 171 542 2815</p>
</text>
